  </header><main class="">
    <section class="hero" id="about" style="padding: 100px 24px !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">
  <div class="container hero-grid" data-cebt="" data-cetx="8" data-cety="-62" style="translate: 8px -62px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;">
    <div class="hero-copy" style="opacity: 1 !important; transform: none;">
      <span class="small">やさしく、ゆっくり、自分らしく。</span>
      <h1 class="heading-xl fxa_pre fxa_cpre" style="line-height: 1.4 !important; font-size: 64px !important; margin-bottom: 0.6em !important; font-weight: 700 !important; --fxa-dur: 800ms; --fxa-stag: 54ms; --fxa-dist: 40px;"><span style="color: rgb(59, 165, 86) !important; -webkit-text-fill-color: rgb(59, 165, 86) !important;"><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 0;">楽</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 1;">し</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 2;">さ</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 3;">を</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 4;">仕</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 5;">事</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 6;">に</span></span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 7;">、</span><br><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 8;">生</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 9;">き</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 10;">生</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 11;">き</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 12;">と</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 13;">し</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 14;">た</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 15;">自</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 16;">分</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 17;">を</span><br><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 18;">見</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 19;">つ</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 20;">け</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 21;">よ</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 22;">う</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 23;">。</span></h1>
      <p class="lead" style="line-height: 1.8 !important;">落ち着いた空間と丁寧なサポートで、「しっかりしている人」も「まだ自信が持てない人」<br>も、自分に合ったペースで働く楽しさを見つけられます。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn" style="background: none rgb(129, 202, 165) !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255) !important; -webkit-text-fill-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) !important; border-width: medium !important; border-style: none !important; border-color: currentcolor !important; border-image: initial !important; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px 4px 16px !important;"><span>見学を予約する</span><span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="#works" class="btn secondary" style="background: none transparent !important; color: rgb(129, 202, 165) !important; -webkit-text-fill-color: rgb(129, 202, 165) !important; border: 2px solid rgb(129, 202, 165) !important;"><span>活動内容を見る</span></a>
